[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12443.99, "timestamp": "03:27:23", "text": "啊，这下糟了。我不知道如何使用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12458.309, "timestamp": "03:27:38", "text": "人们会问乔克，为什么会这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12460.95, "timestamp": "03:27:40", "text": "这边那边是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12463.51, "timestamp": "03:27:43", "text": "为什么重定向功能在这里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12468.389, "timestamp": "03:27:48", "text": "它不应该在下面吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12473.19, "timestamp": "03:27:53", "text": "真的。这正是我最初想要的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12477.11, "timestamp": "03:27:57", "text": "但是，哎呀，呃，直线弹性结构并没有"}]